# Internal working documents. Deliberately not in the public repo: the plan, the research, the
# measurements and the product/design records are how the project was built, not what it is.
# They live on disk and in the backup bundle, and were removed from history rather than merely
# ignored -- ignoring a tracked file hides it from future commits, not from the ones already made.
PROJECT_PLAN.md
PROJECT_IDEA.md
MODEL_NOTES.md
PRODUCT.md
DESIGN.md
.claude/
